it's really twofold.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:20.880
First of all, it's
to raise support

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.790
for the standard Huberman
Lab podcast channel, which,

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:26.370
of course, will still be
continued to be released

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:27.948
every Monday in full length.

00:21:27.948 --> 00:21:29.490
We are not going to
change the format

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:32.970
or anything about the
standard Huberman Lab podcast.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:34.530
And to fund research.

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:37.320
In particular, research done
on human beings, so not animal

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:38.760
models but on
human beings, which

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:40.440
I think we all
agree as a species

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.420
that we are most interested in.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.820
And we are going to
specifically fund

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:47.250
research that is aimed
toward developing

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:49.613
further protocols for mental
health, physical health,

00:21:49.613 --> 00:21:50.280
and performance.

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:52.170
And those protocols
will be distributed

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:53.088
through all channels.

00:21:53.088 --> 00:21:55.380
Not just the premium channel
but through all channels--

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.700
Huberman Lab podcast and
other media channels.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:00.780
So the idea here is to give
you information to your burning

00:22:00.780 --> 00:22:03.930
questions in depth and
allow you the opportunity

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:05.760
to support the kind
of research that

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:08.102
provides those kinds of
answers in the first place.

00:22:08.102 --> 00:22:10.560
Now, and especially exciting
feature of the premium channel

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:13.110
is that the tiny
foundation has generously

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:16.380
offered to do dollar-for-dollar
match on all funds raised

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:18.910
for research through
the premium channel.

00:22:18.910 --> 00:22:20.640
So this is a terrific
way that they're

00:22:20.640 --> 00:22:23.098
going to amplify whatever funds
come in through the premium

00:22:23.098 --> 00:22:25.388
channel to further support
research for science

00:22:25.388 --> 00:22:27.930
and science related tools for
mental health, physical health,

00:22:27.930 --> 00:22:28.737
and performance.

00:22:28.737 --> 00:22:31.320
If you'd like to sign up for the
Huberman Lab premium channel,

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:33.480
again, there's a cost
of $10 per month,

00:22:33.480 --> 00:22:36.150
or you can pay $100 up
front for the entire year.

00:22:36.150 --> 00:22:38.550
That will give you
access to all the AMA's.

00:22:38.550 --> 00:22:41.340
You can ask questions and get
answers to your questions,

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:44.070
and you'll, of course, get
answers to all the questions

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:45.360
that other people ask as well.

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:48.360
There will also be some premium
content such as transcripts

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:51.060
of the AMA's and various
transcripts and protocols

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:54.300
of Huberman lab podcast
episodes not found elsewhere.

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:56.550
And again, you'll be
supporting research

00:22:56.550 --> 00:22:58.780
for mental health, physical
health, and performance.

00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:00.780
You can sign up for the
premium channel by going

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:03.120
to hubermanlab.com/premium.

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:05.880
Again, that's
hubermanlab.com/premium.

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:08.490
And as always, thank you for
your interest in science.

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:11.840
